{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the clock strikes <strong>4:AM</strong>, Aila wakes in a city that no longer follows rules. A near future dystopia lies in ruins, consumed by a substance known as the Yellow.<br><br>With Yellow everywhere light has become a threat. Survival is no longer about strength; it is about awareness, improvisation, and knowing when to disappear.<strong>  <br><br>4:AM</strong> is a cinematic side-scrolling stealth adventure built around player driven problem solving. You will sneak through broken environments, evade continuous dangers, and survive moments where hesitation means death. Instead of following fixed solutions, you copy objects directly from the world around you and repurpose them to create your own way forward. <br> <br>Furniture, debris, light sources, and functional tools can be duplicated and used. Elements such as <strong>electricity, water, and fire</strong> exist naturally in the environment and react based on materials and context.  <br> <br>There is no single correct solution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD IS IN PIECES. USE IT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can duplicate objects from your surroundings and reuse them creatively. Every object can become cover, a distraction, or an escape depending on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0834697eea80edcc6461756319946f38.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0834697eea80edcc6461756319946f38.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0834697eea80edcc6461756319946f38.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PROBLEMS YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge supports multiple approaches like stealth, misdirection, or risky improvisation. Survival doesn\u2019t care how you solve it. Whatever works, works. There\u2019s always more than one way through.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0ee34c931086c92a5c0092e900a52667.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=1754 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0ee34c931086c92a5c0092e900a52667.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0ee34c931086c92a5c0092e900a52667.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREAT OR TOOL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects react differently depending on how they\u2019re used. The same element can protect you, expose you, or turn the environment against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a84f2f36a8b3792749196914a608bcab.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a84f2f36a8b3792749196914a608bcab.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a84f2f36a8b3792749196914a608bcab.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN OR HIDE, YOU DECIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to sound, movement, and disruption. Staying hidden is ideal but sometimes running is the only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a4ea5464e4fbfc64e9569664a35310da.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a4ea5464e4fbfc64e9569664a35310da.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a4ea5464e4fbfc64e9569664a35310da.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WOULD YOU RISK IT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events unfold around you. Intervening is optional and sometimes dangerous. Your actions affect who survives and how the story concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/7dd895b4baf93c32594b46cff797f8c8.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/7dd895b4baf93c32594b46cff797f8c8.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/7dd895b4baf93c32594b46cff797f8c8.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2537270?t=1771001365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/4e2c4690499e0f6a13c204457c98415809bdcc66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771001365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/c9879f36a17992235d2c10bebc15aded1b691fef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771001365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/c9879f36a17992235d2c10bebc15aded1b691fef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771001365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages such as, general mature content, blood, violence and some nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the clock strikes <strong>4:AM</strong>, Aila wakes in a city that no longer follows rules. A near future dystopia lies in ruins, consumed by a substance known as the Yellow.<br><br>With Yellow everywhere light has become a threat. Survival is no longer about strength; it is about awareness, improvisation, and knowing when to disappear.<strong>  <br><br>4:AM</strong> is a cinematic side-scrolling stealth adventure built around player driven problem solving. You will sneak through broken environments, evade continuous dangers, and survive moments where hesitation means death. Instead of following fixed solutions, you copy objects directly from the world around you and repurpose them to create your own way forward. <br> <br>Furniture, debris, light sources, and functional tools can be duplicated and used. Elements such as <strong>electricity, water, and fire</strong> exist naturally in the environment and react based on materials and context.  <br> <br>There is no single correct solution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD IS IN PIECES. USE IT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can duplicate objects from your surroundings and reuse them creatively. Every object can become cover, a distraction, or an escape depending on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0834697eea80edcc6461756319946f38.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0834697eea80edcc6461756319946f38.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0834697eea80edcc6461756319946f38.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PROBLEMS YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge supports multiple approaches like stealth, misdirection, or risky improvisation. Survival doesn\u2019t care how you solve it. Whatever works, works. There\u2019s always more than one way through.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0ee34c931086c92a5c0092e900a52667.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=1754 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0ee34c931086c92a5c0092e900a52667.webm?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/0ee34c931086c92a5c0092e900a52667.mp4?t=1771001365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREAT OR TOOL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects react differently depending on how they\u2019re used. The same element can protect you, expose you, or turn the environment against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537270/extras/a84f2f36a8b3792749196914a608bcab.poster.avif?t=1771001365\" width=1170 height=398 >