 Yellow, Aila must rely on observation and ingenuity to escape a world where light is lethal. Copy objects from the environment, adapt under pressure, and create your own way forward in this dark cinematic stealth adventure.","steam_appid":2537270,"support_info":{"email":"darkzonestudiosuk@gmail.com","url":"https://darkzonestudios.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://darkzonestudios.com/"}